&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fontColorThemeDarkAlt&quot;&gt;WHO WE ARE: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aviatrix® is pioneering the Cloud Native Security Fabric — the architecture the Containment Era requires. The Cloud Native Security Fabric governs every workload communication path across every cloud, every VPC, every Kubernetes cluster, and every serverless function, from a single policy plane. One rule. Universal propagation. Enforced at the workload, not at a chokepoint. Trusted by more than 500 of the world&#39;s leading enterprises. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://aviatrix.ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;aviatrix.ai&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aviatrix Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS) delivers the intelligence, advanced network and security services of Aviatrix’s multi-cloud network platform as a managed offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a hands-on Principal Engineer TL/M - Software Development to join our PaaS team. In this role, you will lead a team of engineers while also contributing to technical execution — defining designs, driving key features, and writing code alongside your team. You will balance engineering leadership with individual technical contributions, owning both people management responsibilities and product components. This is a Tech Lead/Manager (TL/M) role built for a builder who wants to grow as a people leader without leaving the craft behind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive next-generation designs for complex distributed systems using Kubernetes and cloud services (AWS, Azure, GCP), contributing directly to code and architecture alongside your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end lifecycle (requirements, design, delivery, and operations) of key features of the PaaS product; break down large projects into executable sub-projects distributed across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate key engineering tradeoffs and make data-driven technical decisions that balance velocity, quality, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and present design proposals and technical documents that define complex problems and long-term solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a small team of engineers; oversee hiring, career development, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to interviewing and recruiting efforts to attract and retain top engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management to translate business priorities into a clear technical roadmap and execution plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, technical excellence, diversity, equity, and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team in cross-functional forums, collaborating across engineering, product, and go-to-market functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of professional software engineering experience, including hands-on contributions to large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in engineering leadership roles, with direct experience managing engineers and driving team outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Golang and building gRPC-based microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Kubernetes and cloud services (AWS, Azure, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in network routing and network security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating a PaaS/SaaS product at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in data structures, algorithms, operating systems, and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of elegant and robust API and system designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write clean, testable, and maintainable code and hold a high bar for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver results in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills; comfortable working with a geographically distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
